    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Bai Ning Bing probes the crocodile king, it opens its mouth and shoots a dark red lava fireball the size of a stonemill. The fireball arcs, lands on mountain rock, and explodes into a crater with flowing lava. Fang Yuan concludes that attack is rank three lava explosion Gu. He groups it with the king’s defense and healing Gu as the attack piece among attack, defense, and healing. Bai Ning Bing treats that attack Gu as one reason a direct fight is near impossible, even before naming Flame Stomach Gu and Accumulating Ash Gu as the defense and healing problems.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
