  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing scout a mountain valley on the road toward Bai Gu mountain and find a lava crocodile king sunning there as a thousand beast king.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Cited chapters give no Chinese name for this Gu, and none show a Gu Master holding or activating a copy outside that crocodile king scene.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The host is a lava crocodile king sunning in a valley. Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing judge a direct fight too hard, partly because this Gu covers the king’s attack, and they look for a way to use other beast kings against it instead.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lava-crocodile-king-and-lost-chance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A Xuan Yuan Divine Pheasant later kills the crocodile king.",
        "chapters": [
          208
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lava-crocodile-king-and-lost-chance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the pheasant leaves, the two search the corpse. Flame Stomach Gu is already destroyed as glass-like remains. Lava Explosion Gu and Accumulating Ash Gu are gone. Wild Gu leave and roam once the host dies.",
        "chapters": [
          208
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
